# Iron Lady — Brand & Product Context

**Before UI, copy, or feature work**, read `COMPANY_CONTEXT.md` at the project root. It is the canonical source for brand, programs, tone, and design. Do not invent program names, pricing, contact details, or brand colors.

## When to consult it

- New or updated pages, components, empty states, modals, emails, notifications
- User-facing copy (headlines, CTAs, tooltips, errors, onboarding)
- Program-specific flows (student, CX/moderator, admin)
- Theming, typography, spacing, and visual polish

## Quick reference

| Area | Use |
|------|-----|
| **Tagline** | Elevating a million women to the top |
| **Tone** | Direct, ambitious, anti-“balance”; Business War Tactics; winning mindset — not generic empowerment |
| **Programs** | `lep`, `100bm`, `mbw` — match names/structure in `src/data/programTypes.js` and context doc |
