| **Backgrounds** | Cream `#F7F6E4`, warm beige `#EBEADC` |
| **Headings** | Gemunu Libre |
| **Body / UI** | Fira Sans |
| **Support** | admin@iamironlady.com |
| **Site** | https://iamironlady.com |

## UI & feature rules

1. **Align with marketing site** — CTAs, program hierarchy, and visual language should feel like iamironlady.com, adapted for LMS usability.
2. **Program-aware** — Respect entitlements (guest preview vs paid unlock); MBW quarterly modules match website Q1–Q4.
3. **Copy** — Prefer site terminology: B-HAG, Business War Tactics, C-Suite League, shameless pitching, maximize (not balance).
4. **CTAs** — Use patterns from context doc: Explore Programs, Get Started, Apply for the Program, Speak to our Counsellor.
5. **No drift** — Avoid off-brand palettes (e.g. generic blue as primary), stock “empowerment” clichés, or wrong program labels.

## Conflict resolution

If code and `COMPANY_CONTEXT.md` disagree on **brand/product**, update code toward the context doc. If the doc is outdated vs live site, note it and prefer verified facts in the doc until updated.
